
{"ok":true,"value":{"title":"自动布线","remarks":"如不传入任何参数，将对所有未布线的网络进行自动布线","params":[{"name":"props","type":"IPCB_AutoRoutingProps","description":"自动布线参数","required":false}],"returns":{"type":"IPCB_AutoRoutingResult"},"example":"```javascript\n// 对所有未布线的网络进行自动布线\nconst result = await eda.pcb_Document.autoRouting();\nconsole.log(`布线完成：${result.routedNets}/${result.totalNets}`);\n\n// 指定网络进行自动布线，并忽略部分网络\nconst result = await eda.pcb_Document.autoRouting({\n    nets: ['VCC', 'GND', 'SDA', 'SCL'],\n    ignoreNets: ['NC'],\n    cornerStyle: EPCB_AutoRoutingCornerStyle.DEGREE_45,\n    optimization: EPCB_AutoRoutingOptimization.COMPLETION,\n});\n```"},"logs":[],"durationMs":170}
